A TOML key whose value is missing, as while typing one, isn't listed, because a key's outline
line needs its value; the keys and tables around it are listed as usual.
== args
input/broken.toml
== file input/broken.toml
name = "demo"
version =
edition = "2024"

[dependencies]
serde = "1"
== stdout
input/broken.toml (6 lines)
[L1-L1] name = "demo"
[L3-L3] edition = "2024"
[L5-L6] [dependencies]
== stderr
== exit 0
